  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">300713-106 - SRHR - Reproductive health commodities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to UNFPA Supplies Partnership to effectively provide efficient and timely procurement and delivery of RH Commodities to LMICs, placing women and girls at the centre of economic growth. It is estimated that every dollar invested in family planning and maternal health in LMICs can generate a return of USD$8.40 for families and societies by 2035.</narrative>
  </description>
